WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:12,560
Respect Mr. Pei well. Doesn’t your wife know about this?

2
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,480
The prince doesn’t want his wife to worry

3
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,700
I have just ordered my subordinates

4
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,340
Send a message to Madam to rest early

5
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:22,630
Chen's iron tree blossoms

6
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:25,030
The lights are out at Madam's place.

7
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,700
You've always been cold-blooded and stoic

8
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,780
Different, women love each other

9
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,220
He doesn't even know how to make a girl happy

10
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,740
This is a thoughtful magic weapon I carried specially for you.

11
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,940
It will be miraculous in the future

12
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:47,340
I just clearly followed her words.

13
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,070
Why doesn't she look happy?

14
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:53,240
The light in my eyes is getting darker.
